    "description": "Personal AI Scheduled Messages Timeline Sync Rule Template",
    "notes": [
      "All Google Apps Script {{WEB_APP_URL}} callbacks intentionally use GET. Jira Automation POST requests to Apps Script ContentService can stop on the 302 redirect to script.googleusercontent.com.",
      "Release info variables intentionally save {{webhookResponse.body}}. The Apps Script GET URL removes ASCII apostrophes before urlEncode so older deployed Apps Script parsers do not treat unquoted field names such as Kira's group DF as quoted strings."
    ]
  },
